data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","content_index":0,"item_id":"msg_0c505d8c709a0e6b006a7c6aae4e088192a9751032d1be3b03","logprobs":[],"output_index":0,"sequence_number":175,"text":"One innovative solution for reducing food waste in restaurants is the introduction of a \"Dynamic Duo Menu.\" This system leverages real-time data analytics to create and promote meal combinations that efficiently utilize ingredients nearing their expiration.\n\n**Idea:** The \"Dynamic Duo Menu\" concept uses advanced data analysis and customer preferences to dynamically adjust the menu each day. It pairs dishes to ensure optimal use of existing inventory, reducing waste.\n\n**Category:** Business\n\n**Feasibility:** 8\n\n**Resources:**\n1. Data analytics software to monitor inventory and track customer preferences.\n2. Digital menu boards or an app to update menu offerings in real-time.\n3. Staff training for agile kitchen operations and understanding the data systems.\n4. Collaboration with local food banks or compost facilities to manage any remaining waste responsibly.\n5. Marketing resources to communicate and promote the initiative to customers effectively."}

